/P 76 0 R
/T (    The decorative artwork in the sanctuary has begun, as signalled by the scaffolding that has gone up. This week has focused on setup and preparatory work. On Wednesday, we reviewed the proposed colors for the stencils and I think the choices we came out with will beautifully match the sanctuary without overwhelming the space. The stencilwork is meant to be background decoration that helps to highlight the woodworking in the sanctuary.)
/E (    The decorative artwork in the sanctuary has begun, as signalled by the scaffolding that has gone up. This week has focused on setup and preparatory work. On Wednesday, we reviewed the proposed colors for the stencils and I think the choices we came out with will beautifully match the sanctuary without overwhelming the space. The stencilwork is meant to be background decoration that helps to highlight the woodworking in the sanctuary.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
