/T (    In more general renovation news, we have received a new Corrective Action Plan from Shawnee Construction. As we requested, this plan attempts to address the various concerns surrounding the millwork that were highlighted by our architectural team. Though it will be a time-consuming process, the plan seems to be a step in the right direction. The first phase is planning, identifying what type of work or repair is needed in each area.)
/E (    In more general renovation news, we have received a new Corrective Action Plan from Shawnee Construction. As we requested, this plan attempts to address the various concerns surrounding the millwork that were highlighted by our architectural team. Though it will be a time-consuming process, the plan seems to be a step in the right direction. The first phase is planning, identifying what type of work or repair is needed in each area.)
