/S /H3
/P 76 0 R
/T (    The second and final session of the diocesan synod will be this coming week, meeting Friday and Saturday in Fort Wayne. Please keep all delegates in  prayer as we conclude this historic synod for our diocese, the first synod in one hundred years. After its completion, we will look to Bishop Rhoades to highlight the pastoral priorities that he has identified from this process to help guide the direction of our diocese for the years to come.     ~In Christ, Fr. David)
/E (    The second and final session of the diocesan synod will be this coming week, meeting Friday and Saturday in Fort Wayne. Please keep all delegates in  prayer as we conclude this historic synod for our diocese, the first synod in one hundred years. After its completion, we will look to Bishop Rhoades to highlight the pastoral priorities that he has identified from this process to help guide the direction of our diocese for the years to come.     ~In Christ, Fr. David)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [18]
