>>
endobj
702 0 obj
<<
/Title (The decorative artwork in the sanctuary has begun, as signalled by the scaffolding that has gone up. This week has focused on setup and preparatory work. On Wednesday, we reviewed the proposed colors for the stencils and I think the choices we came out with will beautifully match the sanctuary without overwhelming the space. The stencilwork is meant to be background decoration that helps to highlight the woodworking in the sanctuary.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 626 0 R
/Next 751 0 R
>>
endobj
703 0 obj
<<
/Title (In more general renovation news, we have received a new Corrective Action Plan from Shawnee Construction. As we requested, this plan attempts to address the various concerns surrounding the millwork that were highlighted by our architectural team. Though it will be a time-consuming process, the plan seems to be a step in the right direction. The first phase is planning, identifying what type of work or repair is needed in each area.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 626 0 R
/Prev 751 0 R
>>
endobj
